[EXPLAIN] What this step does
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  Final consistency check of the paper against the pipeline outputs. It lists every figure and
  every included file the         manuscript refers to and confirms they exist, and it confirms
  that each result variable used in the text was generated.         A failure here means the text
  refers to something the pipeline did not produce (or no longer produces).
